It's easy to see
That tonight we shall fall in love

322
00:49:30,130 --> 00:49:34,390
I bring you a song

323
00:49:34,470 --> 00:49:38,220
For I'm seeking romance

324
00:49:38,310 --> 00:49:41,270
And you

